This work has been modified. The numeric services under server/app/services/
are ports of the upstream implementation, restructured into a FastAPI job
service; each module's header comment records its upstream source file, and
CLAUDE.md carries the full porting table. Substantial parts of this
distribution — the job server, the web client, the Docker packaging, the
signal-processing core under server/app/sigproc/, and the verification
tooling — are new work and are not derived from the upstream project.
